# PDF Document Types and Field List

Source folder: `AB/`

This is a schema-oriented inventory of the document types and information fields visible in the 14 PDFs. Repeated labels have been normalized for readability. Narrative pleadings are described by the factual fields they contain, even when those facts appear as prose rather than blank form boxes.

